<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>请求未获允许</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body data-csucampuscraft-app="admin" data-authenticated="false">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container site-header-inner">
        <a class="site-brand" href="/" aria-label="CSUCampusCraft 首页">
            <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">CSU</span>
            <span>CSUCampusCraft 管理端</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="站点导航">
            <a href="/">首页</a>
            <span class="app-label">管理端</span>
            

            <a href="/login">登录</a>
            
            
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>
<div class="container global-alerts" aria-label="全局提示区">
    
    
    

</div>
<main id="main-content" class="container main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="panel error-page" aria-labelledby="error-title" data-error-status="403">
    <p class="error-number">403</p>
    <h1 id="error-title">请求未获允许</h1>
    <p>请求校验失败，请重新打开页面后提交。</p>
    <p class="muted">请刷新页面后重新操作，或回到首页。</p>
    <p class="error-code">错误代码：<span>CSRF_REJECTED</span></p>

    <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <span>CSUCampusCraft 校园文创商城</span>
        <span class="muted">课程实验 · 教学模拟</span>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
